        "en": "Clients share divided impressions regarding hospital personnel. Several pet owners warmly praise specific veterinarians like Dr. Lee and Dr. Hernandez for their gentle bedside manner during checkups and end-of-life care. Conversely, multiple reviewers report dismissive interactions and unhelpful attitudes from front-desk staff."
