      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently express frustration with communication practices. Pet owners report difficulty reaching clinic attendants by phone, experiencing long hold times, and feeling inadequately updated when using the daytime drop-off system. Several clients urge clearer explanations of medical plans."
      }
    },
